1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,580
Franklin's kite was never hit by lightning.

2
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:05,760
In seventeen fifty-two, he flew it into a storm

3
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:09,140
cloud holding a dry silk ribbon inside a shed.

4
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:12,100
The loose threads of the twine stood up on end.

5
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,760
He brought his knuckle to the key, and a spark

6
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:16,780
jumped across.

7
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:20,760
If lightning had struck the kite, he would almost

8
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:22,200
certainly have died.
